### FNF-Specific
# File used for the NG API. Should not be shared with others.
APIStuff.hx
art/build_x32-officialrelease.bat
art/build_x64-officialrelease.bat
art/test_x64-debug-officialrelease.bat

# Local-only symlink to the sparse-checked-out psych-scripts mod
# (mods/psych-scripts is a submodule and CI checks out only its fnf_030_ui/).
# It must never be committed: without the submodule the link dangles, and a
# dangling symlink aborts every engine build (#129). Create it yourself with
# `ln -s psych-scripts/fnf_030_ui mods/fnf_030_ui` after initialising the
# submodule -- .github/workflows/sparse-submodule.yml does the same in CI.
mods/fnf_030_ui

### VS Code
build/*
export/*
debug/log/*.log
.vscode/*
.haxelib/
*.code-workspace
# Local history which shouldn't be shared.
.history
.ionide
# macOS file attribute which can cause problems when uploading.
*.DS_Store
# ! means a file should be added regardless of it it gets ignored prior.
# Including to allow others to use already set-up configuration tweaked for the project.
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

### Documentation site (website/)
website/node_modules/
website/build/
website/.docusaurus/
# Generated from source/ by website/scripts/ on every build — never committed.
website/docs/reference/
website/docs/modding/lua-api-reference.md
website/docs/modding/python-api-reference.md

### Python
# Bytecode caches from `python3 -m unittest` / tools/check_dependencies.py.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
